    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Founded in the 1960s, the Seconsett Island Association led efforts to preserve open space and protect native marshlands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://seconsettislandneighborhood.org/seconsett-island-uncovering-the-heart-and-heritage-of-a-hidden-cape-cod-gem/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Seconsett Island sits between Hamblin Pond to the northeast and Waquoit Bay to the southwest, creating a water‑bordered enclave.",
